MERLIN optional FEC engine
--------------------------
The optional Rust FEC adapter uses MERLIN (docsis-ofdm-fec), licensed Apache-2.0,
from https://github.com/mgarcia01752/merlin. Retain the upstream notices and
license texts under LICENSES/merlin when distributing this integration.
SOURCE.txt identifies the selected tag and exact commit. The preserved NOTICE
records ldpc-toolbox provenance, AFF3CT-derived BCH algorithm attribution and
PyPNM QAM resource acknowledgment. The AFF3CT MIT notice is preserved in
AFF3CT-LICENSE-MIT.txt. MERLIN's separate Qt application is not consumed.
These upstream terms do not change RAVEN's component licenses.

