Channel-estimation collection algorithm reference
-------------------------------------------------
Complex snapshot averaging and first-order-edge group delay follow the mathematical
order described by PyPNM's GroupDelayCalculator at commit
82bbf79fe04a0b5e766dc3eb4d5ca2004008bca9. The Rust implementation adds explicit
excluded/zero-response gap handling and has no Python runtime dependency.
